OL,3,AThousands turn out in Serbia for
OL,4,Afuneral of 'Butcher of Bosnia' Ratko
OL,5,AMladiDG
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of people have turned out in
OL,8,FSerbia's capital, Belgrade, to attend
OL,9,Fthe funeral of the convicted war
OL,10,Fcriminal Ratko MladiDG.
OL,12,FWidely known as the Butcher of Bosnia,
OL,13,FMladiDG died at the age of 84 while
OL,14,Fserving a life sentence in the UN
OL,15,Fprison in The Hague, the Netherlands.
OL,17,FHe was found guilty of genocide by a UN
OL,18,Fwar crimes tribunal for his role in the
OL,19,F1995 Srebrenica massacre, when around
OL,20,F8,000 Bosniak Muslim men and boys were
OL,21,Fkilled. It was described as Europe's
OL,22,Fworst atrocity since World War Two.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
