OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in southern Lebanese
OL,4,Avillage kill 12
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli air strikes on a village in
OL,7,Fsouthern Lebanon have killed at least
OL,8,F12 people, the Lebanese health ministry
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FEleven people, including two children
OL,12,Fand four women, were killed in a strike
OL,13,Fthat destroyed a residential building
OL,14,Fin Kfar Roummane overnight. A second
OL,15,Fstrike on a vehicle killed a paramedic.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
